		(property "Function" "Isolates U3B's EREF_BUF output from the pin 6/7 sampling kick and forms the RF low-pass with C101. EREF_BUF runs U3 pin 7 -> R11 pad 1, and the R101 branch taps it at R11 pad 1 (C16 deleted, S-27); land pad 2 next to C101."
			(at 73.66 99.06 0)
			(hide yes)
