		(property "Function" "Converts EREF-VENV (ADC B, pins 6/5) and GND-EREF (ADC A, pins 8/7) simultaneously and streams both with CRC-8 to U8 SPI4. Internal 2.5 V reference (REFSEL = 0, S-26): wait >= 11 ms after power-up (Table 4), no PMODE shutdown or hard reset during a run. SDI carries a constant NOP stream (R105 deleted, S-4). An AD7386 fitted here uses CH=1 (pin 7 EREF, pin 5 VENV). Place on F.Cu between U3/U4 and U8 with the inputs facing the op-amps and the SPI pins facing U8. Tie pin 8, pin 10 and pin 1 to the exposed pad and put a GND via at the pad centre."
			(at 139.7 101.6 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
