		(property "Function" "Isolates U4B's VENV_BUF output from the U13 pin 5 sampling kick and forms the RF low-pass with C102 (100R x 2.2 nF, 0.72 MHz). 100R (S-26) keeps the AINB- overload current <= 5 mA now that the AD7380 internal 2.5 V reference sets the VREF + 0.3 V input limit (AD7380 Rev A Table 5). Place north of C102 and feed pad 1 from U4 pin 7 on F.Cu between C19 and R12."
			(at 73.66 104.14 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
